# convex/_generated/ IS committed: `npx convex codegen` requires an
# authenticated deployment, so CI cannot regenerate it on a fresh checkout.
# The files are derived purely from convex/*.ts and hold no deployment ids or
# secrets. `npm run dev` rewrites them locally; commit the diff when a Convex
# function or the schema changes. The ai/ subdir is tooling, not codegen.
convex/_generated/ai/
